Subject: [PATCH 1/7] kernel-shark-qt: Add plugin infrastructure to be used by the Qt-baset KS.
Date: Wed, 29 Aug 2018 19:42:18 +0300
Message-Id: <20180829164224.20677-2-y.karadz@gmail.com>
In-Reply-To: <20180829164224.20677-1-y.karadz@gmail.com>
